      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "type": "{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What does the Meta Pixel integration do?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It tracks form views and submissions as Meta Pixel events, so you can measure ad-driven conversions, optimize campaigns, and retarget engaged visitors.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I connect Meta Pixel?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Create a Pixel in Meta Events Manager, copy its ID, then paste it into your form's Automate → Integrations → Meta Pixel. Publish and you're tracking.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Where do I find my Pixel ID?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"In Meta Events Manager — open your Pixel and copy its ID, a long number like 896138278069703.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I verify it works?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Install the Meta Pixel Helper Chrome extension and submit a test form — then confirm the events in Meta Events Manager.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is Formester?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Formester is an online form builder for creating forms, surveys, and quizzes with a drag-and-drop editor or AI. It connects with the tools your team already uses — Google Sheets, Slack, HubSpot, Zapier, and more — so your form data flows wherever you need it.\"}}]}"
